Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.19,0:01:31.85,italics,Hikaru,0,0,0,,This brings back memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.31,0:01:35.77,italics,Hikaru,0,0,0,,How long did we keep up \Nthis exchange diary again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.40,0:01:36.16,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs16\fad(278,0)\fnComic Sans MS\b1\bord0\c&H8B8D94&\pos(459.333,74.667)\frx10\fry0}Grandma's house
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.16,0:01:40.10,italics,Hikaru,0,0,0,,I couldn't wait for \Nmy big sister's replies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.85,0:01:42.54,main,Mitsuru,0,0,0,,You drew this entry so well!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.48,0:01:48.04,main,Mitsuru,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll draw today's entry now. \NI can say we went to the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.58,0:01:50.46,main,Mitsuru,0,0,0,,Right, Hikaru?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.46,0:01:52.89,italics,Hikaru,0,0,0,,My big sister is smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.89,0:01:54.45,italics,Hikaru,0,0,0,,That means this is…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.33,0:01:58.68,italics,Hikaru,0,0,0,,That means this is…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.43,0:02:00.41,italics,Hikaru,0,0,0,,a dream.
