Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.93,0:04:22.78,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.69,0:04:27.91,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Ugh. The price of cigarettes \Nwent up again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.17,0:04:31.56,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Seriously, what's up \Nwith the cost of living?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.56,0:04:32.84,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Can't we catch a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.75,0:04:34.96,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Uh-huh…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.42,0:04:37.38,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Number 27, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.38,0:04:38.97,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.97,0:04:41.47,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H3619F2&\fnImpact\3c&H2D2D2D&\t(0,1685,\fs18)\bord0.25\frz357.9\frx24\fry24\move(436.667,249.334,466,222,0,1685)}Staff {\c&H29FF37&}Pick!
